[{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/qwen3-next.png","attributes":{"width":"100%","alt":"Qwen3 Main Image"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate-overseas.aliyuncs.com/qwen3-next.png\" width=\"100%\" alt=\"Qwen3 Main Image\" >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://chat.qwen.ai","label":"QWEN CHAT","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://chat.qwen.ai\" label=\"QWEN CHAT\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/models#c5414da58bjgj","label":"API","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://www.alibabacloud.com/help/en/model-studio/models#c5414da58bjgj\" label=\"API\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-next-68c25fd6838e585db8eeea9d","label":"Hugging Face","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-next-68c25fd6838e585db8eeea9d\" label=\"Hugging Face\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-Next-c314f23bd0264a","label":"ModelScope","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-Next-c314f23bd0264a\" label=\"ModelScope\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://www.kaggle.com/models/qwen-lm/qwen3-next-80b","label":"Kaggle","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://www.kaggle.com/models/qwen-lm/qwen3-next-80b\" label=\"Kaggle\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Qwen/Qwen3-Demo","label":"DEMO","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://huggingface.co/spaces/Qwen/Qwen3-Demo\" label=\"DEMO\" external=true >}}\n","tokens":[]},{"type":"hugoButton","name":"button","href":"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4","label":"DISCORD","external":"true","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< button href=\"https://discord.gg/yPEP2vHTu4\" label=\"DISCORD\" external=true >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Introduction\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Introduction","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Introduction","text":"Introduction","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We believe that **Context Length Scaling** and **Total Parameter Scaling** are two major trends in the future of large models. To further improve training and inference efficiency under long-context and large-parameter settings, we design a brand-new model architecture called Qwen3-Next.Compared to the MoE structure of Qwen3, Qwen3-Next introduces several key improvements: a hybrid attention mechanism, a highly sparse Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) structure, training-stability-friendly optimizations, and a multi-token prediction mechanism for faster inference.","text":"We believe that **Context Length Scaling** and **Total Parameter Scaling** are two major trends in the future of large models. To further improve training and inference efficiency under long-context and large-parameter settings, we design a brand-new model architecture called Qwen3-Next.Compared to the MoE structure of Qwen3, Qwen3-Next introduces several key improvements: a hybrid attention mechanism, a highly sparse Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) structure, training-stability-friendly optimizations, and a multi-token prediction mechanism for faster inference.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We believe that ","text":"We believe that ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Context Length Scaling**","text":"Context Length Scaling","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Context Length Scaling","text":"Context Length Scaling","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" and ","text":" and ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Total Parameter Scaling**","text":"Total Parameter Scaling","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Total Parameter Scaling","text":"Total Parameter Scaling","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" are two major trends in the future of large models. To further improve training and inference efficiency under long-context and large-parameter settings, we design a brand-new model architecture called Qwen3-Next.Compared to the MoE structure of Qwen3, Qwen3-Next introduces several key improvements: a hybrid attention mechanism, a highly sparse Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) structure, training-stability-friendly optimizations, and a multi-token prediction mechanism for faster inference.","text":" are two major trends in the future of large models. To further improve training and inference efficiency under long-context and large-parameter settings, we design a brand-new model architecture called Qwen3-Next.Compared to the MoE structure of Qwen3, Qwen3-Next introduces several key improvements: a hybrid attention mechanism, a highly sparse Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) structure, training-stability-friendly optimizations, and a multi-token prediction mechanism for faster inference.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Based on this new architecture, we train the **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base** model — an 80-billion-parameter model that activates only 3 billion parameters during inference. This base model achieves performance comparable to (or even slightly better than) the dense Qwen3-32B model, while using less than 10% of its training cost (GPU hours). In inference, especially with context lengths over 32K tokens, it delivers more than 10x higher throughput — **achieving extreme efficiency in both training and inference**.","text":"Based on this new architecture, we train the **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base** model — an 80-billion-parameter model that activates only 3 billion parameters during inference. This base model achieves performance comparable to (or even slightly better than) the dense Qwen3-32B model, while using less than 10% of its training cost (GPU hours). In inference, especially with context lengths over 32K tokens, it delivers more than 10x higher throughput — **achieving extreme efficiency in both training and inference**.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Based on this new architecture, we train the ","text":"Based on this new architecture, we train the ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base**","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" model — an 80-billion-parameter model that activates only 3 billion parameters during inference. This base model achieves performance comparable to (or even slightly better than) the dense Qwen3-32B model, while using less than 10% of its training cost (GPU hours). In inference, especially with context lengths over 32K tokens, it delivers more than 10x higher throughput — ","text":" model — an 80-billion-parameter model that activates only 3 billion parameters during inference. This base model achieves performance comparable to (or even slightly better than) the dense Qwen3-32B model, while using less than 10% of its training cost (GPU hours). In inference, especially with context lengths over 32K tokens, it delivers more than 10x higher throughput — ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**achieving extreme efficiency in both training and inference**","text":"achieving extreme efficiency in both training and inference","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"achieving extreme efficiency in both training and inference","text":"achieving extreme efficiency in both training and inference","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":".","text":".","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We develop and release two post-trained versions based on Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base: **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct** and **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking**. We solve the long-standing stability and efficiency issues in reinforcement learning (RL) training caused by the hybrid attention + high-sparsity MoE architecture. This led to improvements in both RL training speed and final performance. ","text":"We develop and release two post-trained versions based on Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base: **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct** and **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking**. We solve the long-standing stability and efficiency issues in reinforcement learning (RL) training caused by the hybrid attention + high-sparsity MoE architecture. This led to improvements in both RL training speed and final performance. ","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We develop and release two post-trained versions based on Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base: ","text":"We develop and release two post-trained versions based on Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base: ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct**","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" and ","text":" and ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking**","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":". We solve the long-standing stability and efficiency issues in reinforcement learning (RL) training caused by the hybrid attention + high-sparsity MoE architecture. This led to improvements in both RL training speed and final performance. ","text":". We solve the long-standing stability and efficiency issues in reinforcement learning (RL) training caused by the hybrid attention + high-sparsity MoE architecture. This led to improvements in both RL training speed and final performance. ","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"The **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct** performs comparably to our flagship model **Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507**, and shows clear advantages in tasks requiring ultra-long context (**up to 256K tokens**). The **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking** excels at complex reasoning tasks — outperforming higher-cost models like **Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507** and **Qwen3-32B-Thinking**, outpeforming the closed-source **Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking** on multiple benchmarks, and approaching the performance of our top-tier model **Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507**.","text":"The **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct** performs comparably to our flagship model **Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507**, and shows clear advantages in tasks requiring ultra-long context (**up to 256K tokens**). The **Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking** excels at complex reasoning tasks — outperforming higher-cost models like **Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507** and **Qwen3-32B-Thinking**, outpeforming the closed-source **Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking** on multiple benchmarks, and approaching the performance of our top-tier model **Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507**.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"The ","text":"The ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct**","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" performs comparably to our flagship model ","text":" performs comparably to our flagship model ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507**","text":"Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507","text":"Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", and shows clear advantages in tasks requiring ultra-long context (","text":", and shows clear advantages in tasks requiring ultra-long context (","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**up to 256K tokens**","text":"up to 256K tokens","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"up to 256K tokens","text":"up to 256K tokens","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":"). The ","text":"). The ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking**","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" excels at complex reasoning tasks — outperforming higher-cost models like ","text":" excels at complex reasoning tasks — outperforming higher-cost models like ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507**","text":"Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507","text":"Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" and ","text":" and ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-32B-Thinking**","text":"Qwen3-32B-Thinking","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-32B-Thinking","text":"Qwen3-32B-Thinking","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":", outpeforming the closed-source ","text":", outpeforming the closed-source ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking**","text":"Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking","text":"Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" on multiple benchmarks, and approaching the performance of our top-tier model ","text":" on multiple benchmarks, and approaching the performance of our top-tier model ","escaped":false},{"type":"strong","raw":"**Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507**","text":"Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507","text":"Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":".","text":".","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We have already released Qwen3-Next on [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-next-68c25fd6838e585db8eeea9d) and [ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-Next-c314f23bd0264a). Additionally, everyone can use the Qwen3-Next service via Alibaba Cloud Model Studio and [NVIDIA API Catalog](https://build.nvidia.com/qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-thinking).","text":"We have already released Qwen3-Next on [Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-next-68c25fd6838e585db8eeea9d) and [ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-Next-c314f23bd0264a). Additionally, everyone can use the Qwen3-Next service via Alibaba Cloud Model Studio and [NVIDIA API Catalog](https://build.nvidia.com/qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-thinking).","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We have already released Qwen3-Next on ","text":"We have already released Qwen3-Next on ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-next-68c25fd6838e585db8eeea9d)","href":"https://huggingface.co/collections/Qwen/qwen3-next-68c25fd6838e585db8eeea9d","title":null,"text":"Hugging Face","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Hugging Face","text":"Hugging Face","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" and ","text":" and ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[ModelScope](https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-Next-c314f23bd0264a)","href":"https://modelscope.cn/collections/Qwen3-Next-c314f23bd0264a","title":null,"text":"ModelScope","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"ModelScope","text":"ModelScope","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":". Additionally, everyone can use the Qwen3-Next service via Alibaba Cloud Model Studio and ","text":". Additionally, everyone can use the Qwen3-Next service via Alibaba Cloud Model Studio and ","escaped":false},{"type":"link","raw":"[NVIDIA API Catalog](https://build.nvidia.com/qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-thinking)","href":"https://build.nvidia.com/qwen/qwen3-next-80b-a3b-thinking","title":null,"text":"NVIDIA API Catalog","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"NVIDIA API Catalog","text":"NVIDIA API Catalog","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":".","text":".","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Key Features\n\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Key Features","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Key Features","text":"Key Features","escaped":false}]},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/archtecture.png","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/archtecture.png\" width=\"80%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Hybrid Architecture: Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention**","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Hybrid Architecture: Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention**","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Hybrid Architecture: Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention**","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Hybrid Architecture: Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention**","text":"**Hybrid Architecture: Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Hybrid Architecture: Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention**","text":"Hybrid Architecture: Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Hybrid Architecture: Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention","text":"Hybrid Architecture: Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention","escaped":false}]}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Linear attention breaks the quadratic complexity of standard attention and is more efficient for long contexts. However, we find that using only linear attention or only standard attention has limitations: linear attention is fast but weak at recall; standard attention is expensive and slow during inference.","text":"Linear attention breaks the quadratic complexity of standard attention and is more efficient for long contexts. However, we find that using only linear attention or only standard attention has limitations: linear attention is fast but weak at recall; standard attention is expensive and slow during inference.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Linear attention breaks the quadratic complexity of standard attention and is more efficient for long contexts. However, we find that using only linear attention or only standard attention has limitations: linear attention is fast but weak at recall; standard attention is expensive and slow during inference.","text":"Linear attention breaks the quadratic complexity of standard attention and is more efficient for long contexts. However, we find that using only linear attention or only standard attention has limitations: linear attention is fast but weak at recall; standard attention is expensive and slow during inference.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Through systematic experiments, we find that Gated DeltaNet [1] offers stronger in-context learning ability than commonly used methods like Sliding Window Attention or Mamba2. When we mix Gated DeltaNet with standard attention at a 3:1 ratio (75% layers use Gated DeltaNet, 25% keep standard attention), the model consistently outperforms any monolithic architecture — achieving both better performance and higher efficiency.\nIn the standard attention layers, we add several enhancements:","text":"Through systematic experiments, we find that Gated DeltaNet [1] offers stronger in-context learning ability than commonly used methods like Sliding Window Attention or Mamba2. When we mix Gated DeltaNet with standard attention at a 3:1 ratio (75% layers use Gated DeltaNet, 25% keep standard attention), the model consistently outperforms any monolithic architecture — achieving both better performance and higher efficiency.\nIn the standard attention layers, we add several enhancements:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Through systematic experiments, we find that Gated DeltaNet [1] offers stronger in-context learning ability than commonly used methods like Sliding Window Attention or Mamba2. When we mix Gated DeltaNet with standard attention at a 3:1 ratio (75% layers use Gated DeltaNet, 25% keep standard attention), the model consistently outperforms any monolithic architecture — achieving both better performance and higher efficiency.","text":"Through systematic experiments, we find that Gated DeltaNet [1] offers stronger in-context learning ability than commonly used methods like Sliding Window Attention or Mamba2. When we mix Gated DeltaNet with standard attention at a 3:1 ratio (75% layers use Gated DeltaNet, 25% keep standard attention), the model consistently outperforms any monolithic architecture — achieving both better performance and higher efficiency.","escaped":false},{"type":"br","raw":"\n"},{"type":"text","raw":"In the standard attention layers, we add several enhancements:","text":"In the standard attention layers, we add several enhancements:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"1) Adopt the output gating mechanism from our prior work [2] to reduce low-rank issues in attention.\n2) Increase the dimension per attention head from 128 to 256.\n3) Apply rotary position encoding only to the first 25% of position dimensions — improving extrapolation to longer sequences.","ordered":true,"start":1,"loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"1) Adopt the output gating mechanism from our prior work [2] to reduce low-rank issues in attention.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Adopt the output gating mechanism from our prior work [2] to reduce low-rank issues in attention.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Adopt the output gating mechanism from our prior work [2] to reduce low-rank issues in attention.","text":"Adopt the output gating mechanism from our prior work [2] to reduce low-rank issues in attention.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Adopt the output gating mechanism from our prior work [2] to reduce low-rank issues in attention.","text":"Adopt the output gating mechanism from our prior work [2] to reduce low-rank issues in attention.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"2) Increase the dimension per attention head from 128 to 256.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Increase the dimension per attention head from 128 to 256.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Increase the dimension per attention head from 128 to 256.","text":"Increase the dimension per attention head from 128 to 256.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Increase the dimension per attention head from 128 to 256.","text":"Increase the dimension per attention head from 128 to 256.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"3) Apply rotary position encoding only to the first 25% of position dimensions — improving extrapolation to longer sequences.","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"Apply rotary position encoding only to the first 25% of position dimensions — improving extrapolation to longer sequences.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Apply rotary position encoding only to the first 25% of position dimensions — improving extrapolation to longer sequences.","text":"Apply rotary position encoding only to the first 25% of position dimensions — improving extrapolation to longer sequences.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Apply rotary position encoding only to the first 25% of position dimensions — improving extrapolation to longer sequences.","text":"Apply rotary position encoding only to the first 25% of position dimensions — improving extrapolation to longer sequences.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Ultra-Sparse MoE: Activating Only 3.7% of Parameters**","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Ultra-Sparse MoE: Activating Only 3.7% of Parameters**","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Ultra-Sparse MoE: Activating Only 3.7% of Parameters**","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Ultra-Sparse MoE: Activating Only 3.7% of Parameters**","text":"**Ultra-Sparse MoE: Activating Only 3.7% of Parameters**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Ultra-Sparse MoE: Activating Only 3.7% of Parameters**","text":"Ultra-Sparse MoE: Activating Only 3.7% of Parameters","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Ultra-Sparse MoE: Activating Only 3.7% of Parameters","text":"Ultra-Sparse MoE: Activating Only 3.7% of Parameters","escaped":false}]}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-Next uses a highly sparse MoE design: 80B total parameters, but only ~3B activated per inference step. Experiments show that, with global load balancing [4], increasing total expert parameters while keeping activated experts fixed steadily reduces training loss.","text":"Qwen3-Next uses a highly sparse MoE design: 80B total parameters, but only ~3B activated per inference step. Experiments show that, with global load balancing [4], increasing total expert parameters while keeping activated experts fixed steadily reduces training loss.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next uses a highly sparse MoE design: 80B total parameters, but only ~3B activated per inference step. Experiments show that, with global load balancing [4], increasing total expert parameters while keeping activated experts fixed steadily reduces training loss.","text":"Qwen3-Next uses a highly sparse MoE design: 80B total parameters, but only ~3B activated per inference step. Experiments show that, with global load balancing [4], increasing total expert parameters while keeping activated experts fixed steadily reduces training loss.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Compared to Qwen3’s MoE (128 total experts, 8 routed), Qwen3-Next expands to 512 total experts, combining 10 routed experts + 1 shared expert — maximizing resource usage without hurting performance.","text":"Compared to Qwen3’s MoE (128 total experts, 8 routed), Qwen3-Next expands to 512 total experts, combining 10 routed experts + 1 shared expert — maximizing resource usage without hurting performance.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Compared to Qwen3’s MoE (128 total experts, 8 routed), Qwen3-Next expands to 512 total experts, combining 10 routed experts + 1 shared expert — maximizing resource usage without hurting performance.","text":"Compared to Qwen3’s MoE (128 total experts, 8 routed), Qwen3-Next expands to 512 total experts, combining 10 routed experts + 1 shared expert — maximizing resource usage without hurting performance.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Training-Stability-Friendly Designs**","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Training-Stability-Friendly Designs**","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Training-Stability-Friendly Designs**","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Training-Stability-Friendly Designs**","text":"**Training-Stability-Friendly Designs**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Training-Stability-Friendly Designs**","text":"Training-Stability-Friendly Designs","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Training-Stability-Friendly Designs","text":"Training-Stability-Friendly Designs","escaped":false}]}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We found that the attention output gating mechanism helps eliminate issues like Attention Sink [5] and Massive Activation [6] , ensuring numerical stability across the model.","text":"We found that the attention output gating mechanism helps eliminate issues like Attention Sink [5] and Massive Activation [6] , ensuring numerical stability across the model.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We found that the attention output gating mechanism helps eliminate issues like Attention Sink [5] and Massive Activation [6] , ensuring numerical stability across the model.","text":"We found that the attention output gating mechanism helps eliminate issues like Attention Sink [5] and Massive Activation [6] , ensuring numerical stability across the model.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"In Qwen3, we use QK-Norm, but notice some layer norm weights become abnormally large. To fix this and further improve stability, Qwen3-Next adopts Zero-Centered RMSNorm [7], and applies weight decay to norm weights to prevent unbounded growth.","text":"In Qwen3, we use QK-Norm, but notice some layer norm weights become abnormally large. To fix this and further improve stability, Qwen3-Next adopts Zero-Centered RMSNorm [7], and applies weight decay to norm weights to prevent unbounded growth.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"In Qwen3, we use QK-Norm, but notice some layer norm weights become abnormally large. To fix this and further improve stability, Qwen3-Next adopts Zero-Centered RMSNorm [7], and applies weight decay to norm weights to prevent unbounded growth.","text":"In Qwen3, we use QK-Norm, but notice some layer norm weights become abnormally large. To fix this and further improve stability, Qwen3-Next adopts Zero-Centered RMSNorm [7], and applies weight decay to norm weights to prevent unbounded growth.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"We also normalize MoE router parameters during initialization [8] , ensuring each expert is unbiasedly selected early in training — reducing noise from random initialization.","text":"We also normalize MoE router parameters during initialization [8] , ensuring each expert is unbiasedly selected early in training — reducing noise from random initialization.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"We also normalize MoE router parameters during initialization [8] , ensuring each expert is unbiasedly selected early in training — reducing noise from random initialization.","text":"We also normalize MoE router parameters during initialization [8] , ensuring each expert is unbiasedly selected early in training — reducing noise from random initialization.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"These stability-focused designs make small-scale experiments more reliable and help large-scale training run smoothly.","text":"These stability-focused designs make small-scale experiments more reliable and help large-scale training run smoothly.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"These stability-focused designs make small-scale experiments more reliable and help large-scale training run smoothly.","text":"These stability-focused designs make small-scale experiments more reliable and help large-scale training run smoothly.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Multi-Token Prediction**","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Multi-Token Prediction**","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Multi-Token Prediction**","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Multi-Token Prediction**","text":"**Multi-Token Prediction**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Multi-Token Prediction**","text":"Multi-Token Prediction","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Multi-Token Prediction","text":"Multi-Token Prediction","escaped":false}]}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-Next introduces a native Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) [3][9][10] mechanism, which not only yields an MTP module with a high acceptance rate for Speculative Decoding but also enhances the overall performance.Additionally, Qwen3-Next specifically optimizes the multi-step inference performance of MTP, further improving the acceptance rate of Speculative Decoding in real scenarios through multi-step training that maintains consistency between training and inference.","text":"Qwen3-Next introduces a native Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) [3][9][10] mechanism, which not only yields an MTP module with a high acceptance rate for Speculative Decoding but also enhances the overall performance.Additionally, Qwen3-Next specifically optimizes the multi-step inference performance of MTP, further improving the acceptance rate of Speculative Decoding in real scenarios through multi-step training that maintains consistency between training and inference.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next introduces a native Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) [3][9][10] mechanism, which not only yields an MTP module with a high acceptance rate for Speculative Decoding but also enhances the overall performance.Additionally, Qwen3-Next specifically optimizes the multi-step inference performance of MTP, further improving the acceptance rate of Speculative Decoding in real scenarios through multi-step training that maintains consistency between training and inference.","text":"Qwen3-Next introduces a native Multi-Token Prediction (MTP) [3][9][10] mechanism, which not only yields an MTP module with a high acceptance rate for Speculative Decoding but also enhances the overall performance.Additionally, Qwen3-Next specifically optimizes the multi-step inference performance of MTP, further improving the acceptance rate of Speculative Decoding in real scenarios through multi-step training that maintains consistency between training and inference.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Pre-training\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Pre-training","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Pre-training","text":"Pre-training","escaped":false}]},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Pretraining Efficiency & Inference Speed**","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Pretraining Efficiency & Inference Speed**","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Pretraining Efficiency & Inference Speed**","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Pretraining Efficiency & Inference Speed**","text":"**Pretraining Efficiency & Inference Speed**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Pretraining Efficiency & Inference Speed**","text":"Pretraining Efficiency & Inference Speed","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Pretraining Efficiency & Inference Speed","text":"Pretraining Efficiency & Inference Speed","escaped":false}]}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01FUbdQa1i6J7tAfCCn_!!6000000004363-2-tps-2860-1114.png","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://img.alicdn.com/imgextra/i1/O1CN01FUbdQa1i6J7tAfCCn_!!6000000004363-2-tps-2860-1114.png\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-Next is trained on a uniformly sampled subset (15T tokens) of Qwen3’s 36T-token pretraining corpus. It uses less than 80% of the GPU hours needed by Qwen3-30A-3B, and only 9.3% of the compute cost of Qwen3-32B — while achieving better performance. This shows outstanding training efficiency and value.","text":"Qwen3-Next is trained on a uniformly sampled subset (15T tokens) of Qwen3’s 36T-token pretraining corpus. It uses less than 80% of the GPU hours needed by Qwen3-30A-3B, and only 9.3% of the compute cost of Qwen3-32B — while achieving better performance. This shows outstanding training efficiency and value.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next is trained on a uniformly sampled subset (15T tokens) of Qwen3’s 36T-token pretraining corpus. It uses less than 80% of the GPU hours needed by Qwen3-30A-3B, and only 9.3% of the compute cost of Qwen3-32B — while achieving better performance. This shows outstanding training efficiency and value.","text":"Qwen3-Next is trained on a uniformly sampled subset (15T tokens) of Qwen3’s 36T-token pretraining corpus. It uses less than 80% of the GPU hours needed by Qwen3-30A-3B, and only 9.3% of the compute cost of Qwen3-32B — while achieving better performance. This shows outstanding training efficiency and value.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Thanks to its hybrid architecture, Qwen3-Next also shines in inference:\n","text":"Thanks to its hybrid architecture, Qwen3-Next also shines in inference:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Thanks to its hybrid architecture, Qwen3-Next also shines in inference:","text":"Thanks to its hybrid architecture, Qwen3-Next also shines in inference:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"list","raw":"1) **Prefill Stage**: At 4K context length, throughput is nearly 7x higher than Qwen3-32B. Beyond 32K, it’s over 10x faster.\n2) **Decode Stage**: At 4K context, throughput is nearly 4x higher. Even beyond 32K, it still maintains over 10x speed advantage.","ordered":true,"start":1,"loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"1) **Prefill Stage**: At 4K context length, throughput is nearly 7x higher than Qwen3-32B. Beyond 32K, it’s over 10x faster.\n","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Prefill Stage**: At 4K context length, throughput is nearly 7x higher than Qwen3-32B. Beyond 32K, it’s over 10x faster.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Prefill Stage**: At 4K context length, throughput is nearly 7x higher than Qwen3-32B. Beyond 32K, it’s over 10x faster.","text":"**Prefill Stage**: At 4K context length, throughput is nearly 7x higher than Qwen3-32B. Beyond 32K, it’s over 10x faster.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Prefill Stage**","text":"Prefill Stage","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Prefill Stage","text":"Prefill Stage","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": At 4K context length, throughput is nearly 7x higher than Qwen3-32B. Beyond 32K, it’s over 10x faster.","text":": At 4K context length, throughput is nearly 7x higher than Qwen3-32B. Beyond 32K, it’s over 10x faster.","escaped":false}]}]},{"type":"list_item","raw":"2) **Decode Stage**: At 4K context, throughput is nearly 4x higher. Even beyond 32K, it still maintains over 10x speed advantage.","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Decode Stage**: At 4K context, throughput is nearly 4x higher. Even beyond 32K, it still maintains over 10x speed advantage.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Decode Stage**: At 4K context, throughput is nearly 4x higher. Even beyond 32K, it still maintains over 10x speed advantage.","text":"**Decode Stage**: At 4K context, throughput is nearly 4x higher. Even beyond 32K, it still maintains over 10x speed advantage.","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Decode Stage**","text":"Decode Stage","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Decode Stage","text":"Decode Stage","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":": At 4K context, throughput is nearly 4x higher. Even beyond 32K, it still maintains over 10x speed advantage.","text":": At 4K context, throughput is nearly 4x higher. Even beyond 32K, it still maintains over 10x speed advantage.","escaped":false}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/prefill.jpg","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/prefill.jpg\" width=\"80%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/decode.jpg","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/decode.jpg\" width=\"80%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Base Model Performance**","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Base Model Performance**","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Base Model Performance**","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Base Model Performance**","text":"**Base Model Performance**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Base Model Performance**","text":"Base Model Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Base Model Performance","text":"Base Model Performance","escaped":false}]}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base activates only 1/10th of the non-embedding parameters used by Qwen3-32B-Base — yet outperforms it on most benchmarks, and significantly beats Qwen3-30B-A3B. This demonstrates exceptional efficiency and strong performance.","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base activates only 1/10th of the non-embedding parameters used by Qwen3-32B-Base — yet outperforms it on most benchmarks, and significantly beats Qwen3-30B-A3B. This demonstrates exceptional efficiency and strong performance.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base activates only 1/10th of the non-embedding parameters used by Qwen3-32B-Base — yet outperforms it on most benchmarks, and significantly beats Qwen3-30B-A3B. This demonstrates exceptional efficiency and strong performance.","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Base activates only 1/10th of the non-embedding parameters used by Qwen3-32B-Base — yet outperforms it on most benchmarks, and significantly beats Qwen3-30B-A3B. This demonstrates exceptional efficiency and strong performance.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/base_performance.jpg","attributes":{"width":"80%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/base_performance.jpg\" width=\"80%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Post-training\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Post-training","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Post-training","text":"Post-training","escaped":false}]},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Instruct Model Performance**","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Instruct Model Performance**","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Instruct Model Performance**","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Instruct Model Performance**","text":"**Instruct Model Performance**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Instruct Model Performance**","text":"Instruct Model Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Instruct Model Performance","text":"Instruct Model Performance","escaped":false}]}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct significantly outperforms Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507 and Qwen3-32B-Non-thinking, and achieves results nearly matching our flagship Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507.","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct significantly outperforms Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507 and Qwen3-32B-Non-thinking, and achieves results nearly matching our flagship Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct significantly outperforms Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507 and Qwen3-32B-Non-thinking, and achieves results nearly matching our flagship Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507.","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct significantly outperforms Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507 and Qwen3-32B-Non-thinking, and achieves results nearly matching our flagship Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct.001.jpeg","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct.001.jpeg\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"On RULER, Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct outperforms Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507 (which has more attention layers) across all lengths — and even beats Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507 (which has more layers overall) within 256K context. This proves the strength of the Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention hybrid design for long-context tasks.","text":"On RULER, Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct outperforms Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507 (which has more attention layers) across all lengths — and even beats Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507 (which has more layers overall) within 256K context. This proves the strength of the Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention hybrid design for long-context tasks.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"On RULER, Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct outperforms Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507 (which has more attention layers) across all lengths — and even beats Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507 (which has more layers overall) within 256K context. This proves the strength of the Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention hybrid design for long-context tasks.","text":"On RULER, Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct outperforms Qwen3-30B-A3B-Instruct-2507 (which has more attention layers) across all lengths — and even beats Qwen3-235B-A22B-Instruct-2507 (which has more layers overall) within 256K context. This proves the strength of the Gated DeltaNet + Gated Attention hybrid design for long-context tasks.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/ruler.jpg","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/ruler.jpg\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"list","raw":"- **Thinking Model Performance**","ordered":false,"start":"","loose":false,"items":[{"type":"list_item","raw":"- **Thinking Model Performance**","task":false,"loose":false,"text":"**Thinking Model Performance**","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"**Thinking Model Performance**","text":"**Thinking Model Performance**","tokens":[{"type":"strong","raw":"**Thinking Model Performance**","text":"Thinking Model Performance","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Thinking Model Performance","text":"Thinking Model Performance","escaped":false}]}]}]}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking outperforms higher-cost models like Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507 and Qwen3-32B-Thinking. It beats the closed-source Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking on multiple benchmarks, and comes close to our latest flagship model Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507 on key metrics.","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking outperforms higher-cost models like Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507 and Qwen3-32B-Thinking. It beats the closed-source Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking on multiple benchmarks, and comes close to our latest flagship model Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507 on key metrics.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking outperforms higher-cost models like Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507 and Qwen3-32B-Thinking. It beats the closed-source Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking on multiple benchmarks, and comes close to our latest flagship model Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507 on key metrics.","text":"Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking outperforms higher-cost models like Qwen3-30B-A3B-Thinking-2507 and Qwen3-32B-Thinking. It beats the closed-source Gemini-2.5-Flash-Thinking on multiple benchmarks, and comes close to our latest flagship model Qwen3-235B-A22B-Thinking-2507 on key metrics.","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"hugoFigure","name":"figure","src":"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/thinking_performance.jpeg","attributes":{"width":"100%"},"raw":"{{< figure src=\"https://qianwen-res.oss-accelerate.aliyuncs.com/Qwen3-Next/thinking_performance.jpeg\" width=\"100%\">}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"<br><br>","text":"<br><br>","tokens":[{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"},{"type":"html","raw":"<br>","inLink":false,"inRawBlock":false,"block":false,"text":"<br>"}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"heading","raw":"## Develop with Qwen3\n\n","depth":2,"text":"Develop with Qwen3","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"Develop with Qwen3","text":"Develop with Qwen3","escaped":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"All examples below are based on the Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct version. For the Thinking model, please refer to <https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking>.","text":"All examples below are based on the Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct version. For the Thinking model, please refer to <https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Thinking>.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"All examples below are based on the Qwen3-Next-80B-A3B-Instruct version. For t