rvice. ","tokens":[{"type":"link","raw":"[vLLM](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm)","href":"https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm","title":null,"text":"vLLM","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"vLLM","text":"vLLM","escaped":false}]},{"type":"text","raw":" is a high-throughput and memory-efficient inference and serving engine for LLMs. vLLM could be used to launch a server with OpenAI-compatible API service. ","text":" is a high-throughput and memory-efficient inference and serving engine for LLMs. vLLM could be used to launch a server with OpenAI-compatible API service. ","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"vLLM has supported Qwen3-Next in its `main` branch, which can be installed from source:","text":"vLLM has supported Qwen3-Next in its `main` branch, which can be installed from source:","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"vLLM has supported Qwen3-Next in its ","text":"vLLM has supported Qwen3-Next in its ","escaped":false},{"type":"codespan","raw":"`main`","text":"main"},{"type":"text","raw":" branch, which can be installed from source:","text":" branch, which can be installed from source:","escaped":false}]},{"type":"code","name":"code","src":"https://docs.qwenlm.ai/research/qwen3-next/code/520a910b-5485-4381-a0f2-7241ccea020d.sh","lang":"shell","attributes":{},"raw":"{{< code src=\"./code/520a910b-5485-4381-a0f2-7241ccea020d.sh\" lang=\"shell\" >}}","tokens":[]},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"}}","text":"}}","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"}}","text":"}}","escaped":false}]},{"type":"space","raw":"\n\n"},{"type":"paragraph","raw":"The following command can be used to create an API endpoint at `http://localhost:8000/v1` with maximum context length 256K tokens using tensor parallel on 4 GPUs.","text":"The following command can be used to create an API endpoint at `http://localhost:8000/v1` with maximum context length 256K tokens using tensor parallel on 4 GPUs.","tokens":[{"type":"text","raw":"The following command can be used to crea